  <item>
    <title>Vol.19 不管何时，仍能收获“向你飞奔而来”的爱｜聊聊宠物</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6717cd4cdb2cf827572fd2a3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6717cd4cdb2cf827572fd2a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Oct 2024 16:05:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>狗狗sexy过1岁生日啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天来聊聊养的狗狗sexy，从他2个月来到我们家，转眼他就1岁生日啦！在养狗最难的日子里，我们一把屎一把尿，教会他最基础的一些本领，尽可能带他去见了很多没见过的人和事。聊起来，才发现我们从sexy那里获得的太多了！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📝时间戳:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 小时候养过的各种宠物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">09:02</a> 本想放生，却害了他？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1628">27:08</a> 见到sexy的第一眼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 本想驯服他，结果被他驯服？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2997">49:57</a> 养狗最幸福的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3683">61:23</a> 是否建议养狗</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎼本期BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>稻香（童声版） - 卡罗尔</span></p><span></span><p><span>誠に遺憾ながら、知り合い？- 高橋邦幸</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎧节目上线平台：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>苹果Podcast | 小宇宙 | 荔枝FM</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>刚刚来到我们家的sexy:</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhggxSyTp6f5OCqiZ6gGJ8T9PcWp.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
